pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# NP-8.3 live credits: with cheats on (--pinyon_shift_cheats=true), from seed
# appdata-2026-09-27 (167,700 Cr). F10 opens the trainer over free roam and
# the title pauses into its pause menu, which shows the balance top right.
# Setting cheat_set_credits to 1234567 sets it at once through the title's
# own setter (1,234,567 Cr), and TRAINER > PLAYER > ADD CREDITS (+1,000,000)
# adds on top of it (2,234,567 Cr); both log cheat.applied with the balance
# before and after.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1200 free-roam
hostkey 1300 f10
capture 1340 before
cvar 1360 cheat_set_credits 1234567
capture 1400 set
hostkey 1420 down
hostkey 1440 enter
capture 1470 player
hostkey 1480 down
hostkey 1500 enter
capture 1530 added
hostkey 1560 escape
hostkey 1580 escape
capture 1680 closed
stop 1740
